<title>USA: Superior unit completes Comsul acquisition.</title>
<headline>Superior unit completes Comsul acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Consultant Holdings Corp said Tuesday its information technology consulting unit, Enterprise Consulting Group, completed its acquisition of COMSUL Ltd.</p>
<p>The merger is a pooling of interests valued at $8.3 million and is expected to be accretive for 1997. COMSUL's revenues for the past 12 months were about $7.5 million.</p>
<p>COMSUL provides technology consulting and project management services for some 3,000 entities.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
